# Client UI

Android stays Kotlin Jetpack Compose. iOS stays SwiftUI. The admin console stays the React and Vite app in apps/console. Do not add a React Native app. Do not call the backend SAP or Oracle. The API is the Go service in this repo.

Touch targets are at least 44 points on every client. A swipe only opens a sheet. Approve, reject, and flag for review commit only from an explicit button on that sheet. Reject needs a reason.

```text
# wrong
onSwipeRight { postApprove(request) }

# right
onSwipeRight { openSheet(request, "approve") }
ApproveButton { postApprove(request) }
```
